mbers Parents Bus & Shuttle Schedules Athletics GET INFO VISIT APPLY Home \\ About Felician University \\ Careers at Felician Faculty Adjunct \u2013 Mathematics Felician University is offering exciting opportunities for Adjunct Professors in Mathematics for the 2026-2027 academic year (Fall 2026 and Spring 2027 semesters). Under the mentorship of full-time faculty, adjunct instructors will provide classroom experiences grounded in \u201cbest practices\u201d for higher education and their respective disciplines. Position Type: Part-time, 1-2 courses per semester during the 2026-2027 academic year, maximum 3 days per week. \u00a0Day and evening classes available. Online and traditionsl classroom formates available. Department: School of Arts and Sciences, Mathematics Department Required Education: Master\u2019s degree in Mathematics or closely related field required, Doctoral degree preferred. Qualifications: Experience teaching at the baccalaureate or graduate level reequired; evidence of onine teaching experience; ability and willingness to support the Felician Franciscan mission and values of the University. To Apply: Send cover letter, current curriculum vitae, and the names of two professional references electronically to Interim Associate Dean or via USPS to: Dr. Gaby Fahmy School of Arts & Sciences Felician University 262 South Main Street Lodi, New Jersey \u00a007644 Salary: Commensurate with rank and experience. Start Date: Review of candidate materials will begin effective immediately. About Felician University CONTACT INFORMATION Felician University One Felician Way Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 Phone: 201.559.6000 Phone: 201.355.1465 Contact Us | Directions & Maps | Campus Emergency Information | Request Information | Students Right to Know and Achievement | Privacy policy | Anti-Discrimination Policy | Accessibility TOP Felician University - One Felician Way, Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 201.559.6000 / 201.355.1465 Close GDPR Cookie Settings Privacy Overvi