 Parsippany location. Clinical Adjuncts oversee the clinical education of Prelicensure BSN nursing students with responsibility for evaluating the clinical experience of students and grading clinical assignments. They collaborate closely with the course lead to ensure that clinical learning objectives are achieved. Felician University is committed to maintaining a learning and employment environment based upon our core values of Respect for Human Dignity , Compassion , Transformation , Justice and Peace, and Solidarity with People in Need. Position Type: Part-time, 1-2 courses per semester, maximum 3 days per week. Department: School of Nursing, Hybrid Prelicensure BSN Program Required Education: Master\u2019s degree in nursing Qualifications: Current New Jersey RN license in good standing; current certification in CPR; experience teaching at the baccalaureate level; willingness and ability to support and promote the Felician Franciscan core values and mission of the University. To Apply: Send cover letter, current curriculum vitae, and the names and contact information for two professional references electronically to the Associate Dean or via USPS to: Dr. Erin Vitale, Associate Dean Hybrid ABSN School of Nursing Felician University 262 South Main Street Lodi, New Jersey 07644 Salary: $80.00/hour About Felician University CONTACT INFORMATION Felician University One Felician Way Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 Phone: 201.559.6000 Phone: 201.355.1465 Contact Us | Directions & Maps | Campus Emergency Information | Request Information | Students Right to Know and Achievement | Privacy policy | Anti-Discrimination Policy | Accessibility TOP Felician University - One Felician Way, Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 201.559.6000 / 201.355.1465 Close GDPR Cookie Settings Privacy Overview Strictly Necessary Cookies Powered by GDPR Cookie Compliance (opens in a new tab) Privacy Overview This website uses cookies so that we can provide you with the best user experience possible. Cooki